  "instructions": "<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 1\"><div class=\"layoutArea\"><div class=\"column\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium;\"></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Four prerequisites are required for admission for all GEPN applicants.\u00a0<strong><b>Two of these courses must be complete with transcripts submitted at the time of application.\u00a0</b></strong>The fourth course must be complete before August 15th prior to matriculation into the school. A grade of B (3.0) or better is required for each of the four prerequisites.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Prerequisites must be taken at an accredited college or university (including community college) either in person or online within the last 8 years prior to application submission. AP credits are not acceptable to fulfill the following required courses.</p><p></p></div></div></div>",
